* Independent linear controlled-source classes and forward current sense
.subckt controlled p1 p2 ref gm=2m beta=.3
Rin p1 ref 50
Rsense sense ref 100
Gout cnode ref p1 ref {gm} m = 2
Fout cnode ref VsEnSe {beta} m=1.5
Rc cnode ref 300
Evoltage ev ref p1 ref -1.5
Hvoltage hv ref vsense 10
Re ev p2 30
Rh hv p2 40
Rg cnode p2 200
Cload p2 ref 1p
Vsense p1 sense DC 0
Vbias bias ref DC 5
Rb bias p1 500
.ends controlled
